## Graduation criteria (pre-registered)

- **Screen → real money:** ≥800 graded prices with the beat-close rate 95% CI excluding 50%.
- **Projection → published rows:** |t| > 2 on `(result−line) ~ (proj−line)` for a season the parameters were never fitted on. Current: spreads +0.007 (t=0.13, n=1,578), totals −0.107 (t=−2.77), Week-1 −0.046 (t=−0.17).
- **A winning week is never a reason.**
